        "assets": [],
        "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/appwrite/appwrite/tarball/2.6.1",
        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/appwrite/appwrite/zipball/2.6.1",
        "body": "Appwrite 2.6.1 is a precautionary maintenance release that moves the runtime to PHP 8.5.12. It ships with the same 1.2.97 self-hosted Console as 2.6.0, has no schema changes, and upgrading from 2.6.0 only replaces the images.\n\n### Security\n\n- Update PHP from 8.5.11 to 8.5.12 through `appwrite/base` 2.2.6 (appwrite/docker-base#125). PHP 8.5.12 fixes [CVE-2026-109618](https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w) and [CVE-2026-109619](https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp) (\"PHP2Shell\"). **Appwrite is not affected by either one:** it serves requests through Swoole rather than PHP's web SAPIs (mod_php, PHP-FPM, CGI). This release keeps the runtime on the patched version anyway.\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\ndocker run -it --rm \\\n    --volume /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\\n    --volume \"$(pwd)\"/appwrite:/usr/src/code/appwrite:rw \\\n    --entrypoint=\"install\" \\\n    appwrite/appwrite:2.6.1\n```\n\n### Upgrade\n\nUpgrading from 2.6.0 uses the same command with `--entrypoint=\"upgrade\"`, then run the migration, which has nothing to change for this release:\n\n```bash\ncd appwrite\ndocker compose exec appwrite migrate\n```\n\n**Back up your data first.**\n\n### Contributors\n\nThank you to everyone who contributed to 2.6.1:\n\n@loks0n @ChiragAgg5k\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/appwrite/appwrite/compare/2.6.0...2.6.1\n",
        "mentions_count": 2
      },
      "error": null
    },
